  </Callout>

  <section>
    <h2>Indoor Grow Tent Sizing</h2>
    <p>The tent is the foundation of an indoor grow. It controls light leaks (critical for photoperiod flowering), contains the odor (when paired with a carbon filter), and lets you create a sealed environment where temperature, humidity, and CO₂ can be managed independently of the room around it.</p>

    <div class="calendar-table-wrap">
