    <p>This is the Maine-specific data point no national grow-guide site publishes. Maine has two investor-owned utilities: <strong>CMP</strong> (Central Maine Power, serving most of southern / central / western Maine) and <strong>Versant Power</strong> (formerly Emera Maine, serving northern and eastern Maine).</p>

    <h3>CMP Time-of-Use rate (effective January 1, 2026)</h3>

    <p>CMP launched an optional Time-of-Use (TOU) delivery rate in January 2026. This is a real cost-saver for indoor growers who schedule their lights to run during off-peak hours.</p>

