          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Winter (Jan-Feb)</td><td>50-55°F</td><td>75-80°F</td><td><strong>Add heater</strong> (100-300W radiator, $25-50)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Spring / Fall</td><td>55-65°F</td><td>75-80°F</td><td>LED waste heat may be sufficient + small heater</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Summer</td><td>60-70°F</td><td>75-80°F</td><td>LED heat + room may be sufficient; active cooling rarely needed in Maine</td></tr>
